@startuml F8.2-D02-abrir-ticket
title F8.2-D02 — Abrir ticket (motor de solicitações)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateRequestUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres
participant "Outbox" as Outbox

User -> WebApp: envia ticket
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests\ntipoCodigo=SUPORTE_TECNICO
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: BEGIN + INSERT request
UC -> Outbox: enqueue notify suporte
UC -> Postgres: COMMIT
UC --> WebApp: 201 protocolo
WebApp --> User: ticket aberto

@enduml
